<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-PROKUROROV WINS 30 KM GOLD.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-PROKUROROV WINS 30 KM GOLD.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian Alexey Prokurorov won the 30 km freestyle cross-country at the Nordic skiing world championships on Friday.</p>
<p>Bjorn Daehlie of Noerway took silver and compatriot Thomas Alsgaard bronze, according to provisional results.</p>
